# Game saves. FTK2 save state embeds the Steam64 id of every player who was in the
# room, so a captured co-op save is other people's PII. Keep them outside the repo
# (see SECURITY.md); local tooling reads them from FTK2_FIXTURE_DIR.
*.ftk2
*.sav
FTK2.Crucible/data/Fixtures/
